name=Mod Options Control (Server)
id=ModOptionsControl
description=Lets server admins set Mod Options (Options > Mods) for everyone and choose which ones players may still change. Locked options can be greyed out or hidden. Default: everything stays free until an admin locks something. Works with every mod that uses the game's own Mod Options (PZAPI.ModOptions).
author=Very Far Away
modversion=1.0
versionMin=42.13
